Camera swings to a low diagonal angle.
The dragon surges through a sea of swirling paper ribbons.
Drums hit: synchronized bursts of paper dust.

S3 — Overhead Spiral (1.2–2.1s)

Top-down view: the dragon coils in a circular motion like a dragon dance troupe.
Paper coils scatter from its movement like cut confetti.

S4 — Drum Shockwave (2.1–3.0s)

With each heavy drum beat, shockwaves ripple across the paper ocean.
The dragon roars — ripples become concentric waves of colored strips.

