Side-by-side shot: dragon glides, leaving long trailing ribbons that behave like liquid paper streams.
Motion blur is painterly, not digital.

S10 — Vertical Surge (9.5–11.0s)

Camera tilts up as the dragon rises vertically through a storm of floating curl-strips.
Lighting becomes radiant pastel.

S11 — Confetti Cyclone (11.0–12.5s)

Dragon roars and spins; the entire frame erupts into a cyclone of paper-flakes and spirals.
